WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.560
Probability tells us how likely something is. We can write it as a fraction.

00:07.010 --> 00:12.165
Say a bag has ten counters. Three are blue, and seven are not.

00:12.615 --> 00:18.188
We pick one without looking. There are three blue out of ten counters.

00:18.638 --> 00:24.850
So the probability of picking blue is three out of ten. That is zero point three,

00:24.850 --> 00:26.231
or thirty percent.

00:26.681 --> 00:33.717
Probability is always between zero and one. Zero means impossible. One means certain.
